# Mathua Request Flow  --  Answer Submission

direction: right

Client: Client\nWeb Browser

Server: HTTP Server\nnet/http Mux

Auth: Auth Middleware\nJWT Validation

Handler: handleAnswer\n/api/answer POST

Engine: Engine.SubmitAnswer\n(sessionID, studentID, answer, elapsed)

Grade: gradeAnswer\nGenerator.Grade || Router.Grade

Grader: Grader Router → Numeric/SymPy/etc

Mastery: mastery.Machine.Next()\nStatus Transition

SM2: scheduler.ComputeSM2()\nSpaced Repetition

Upsert: repo.UpsertProgress()\nON CONFLICT UPSERT

Weakness: PropagateWeakness()\nTo Dependents

Attempt: RecordAttempt()\nINSERT INTO attempts

XP: computeXP() + repo.AddXP()

Next: Engine.NextQuestion()\nLoad next problem

Response: JSON Response\nresult + next question

# Flow
Client -> Server: POST /api/answer
Server -> Auth: Validate Token
Auth -> Handler: studentID in context
Handler -> Engine: SubmitAnswer()
Engine -> Grade: Route to grader
Grade -> Grader: Grade expected vs answer
Grader -> Mastery: result + metrics
Mastery -> SM2: Quality score (0-5)
SM2 -> Upsert: Save progress + SM-2 state
Upsert -> Weakness: If >0.3 propagate
Weakness -> Attempt: Record attempt
Attempt -> XP: Compute and add XP
XP -> Next: Get next question
Next -> Response: JSON to client
Response -> Client

